{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128190039804-1128_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261128190039\"/><p>特朗普（左）稱普京（右）為朋友。</p><p>美國總統特朗普上周在中國深圳舉行的亞太經合組織（APEC）峰會上，稱俄羅斯總統普京為「我的朋友」。烏克蘭總統澤連斯基近日表示，普京是侵略者及殺人兇手，不可能是朋友。他形容特朗普的做法，無異於二戰期間稱呼德國元首希特拉是好朋友。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:17:48.886640+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:00:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:30.952119+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:24.515007+00:00","content_hash":"0dbbdc3dd382fadf46d64aea6eaa844d6bc3c06b4eff00b31d3b643ef2b88320","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}